{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22929","headline":"赠内子 · 白居易","name":"赠内子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白发长兴叹，青娥亦伴愁。\n寒衣补灯下，小女戏牀头。\n闇澹屏帏故，凄凉枕席秋。\n贫中有等级，犹胜嫁黔娄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}